  storyText: "DEBUG / CHEAT ROOM - WITH PERK SWAPPER\n   ================================================================= */"
  narrativeBeats:
  - /* 1. FORCE GAME STATE VARIABLES */
  - "\U0001F6E0\uFE0F DEBUG / CHEAT ROOM\n\"Simulation Mode Active. State: LIVE.\""
  - 'Warning: Adding too many items will fill your bag. Use "CLEAR BAG" first.'
  - "/* ===== PANEL 1: CHARACTER BUILD ===== */\n    \n        1. SET JOB"
  - "/* ===== PANEL 1B: QUICK PERK SWAPPER ===== */\n    \n        \U0001F9EA PERK SWAPPER (Quick Test)"
  - 'Current Perk:'
  - "/* ===== PANEL 2: WEAPONS ===== */\n    \n        2. WEAPONS"
  - "/* ===== PANEL 3: GEAR & AMMO ===== */\n    \n        3. GEAR / AMMO"
  - "/* ===== PANEL 4: CONSUMABLES (USE TEST) ===== */\n    \n        4. TEST 'USE'"
  - "/* ===== PANEL 5: TOOLS & JUNK ===== */\n    \n        5. UTILITY"
  - "/* ===== PANEL 6: CONTROLS ===== */\n    \n        6. CONTROLS"
  - "\U0001F4D6 TESTING GUIDE:"
  - 'AUTOMATIC TRAITS (Test Immediately):'
  - "STEADY HANDS: Pick a gun. Note hit % WITHOUT perk. Swap to STEADY HANDS. Hit % should be +15. \u2705\n    FIELD MEDIC: Get low HP. Use First Aid Kit WITHOUT perk (heals 15). Clear perk. Use FIELD MEDIC perk (heals 30). \u2705\n    GARDENER: Use Energy Bar WITHOUT perk (50 stamina). Use with GARDENER perk (75 stamina). \u2705\n    BASEBALL: Start combat. Without perk, crits ~15%. With BASEBALL, crits ~30%. \u2705\n    BOXER: Start combat unarmed. Without perk: \"\U0001F44A You shoved/stomped...\" With perk: \"\U0001F44A\U0001F4A5 BRUTAL!\" \u2705\n    WATCHMAN: Time doesn't pass in debug, but logic checks for night (7 PM - 6 AM). \u2705\n    ADRENALINE: Get HP below 50%. Start combat. Skill bonus should be +10. \u2705\n    GAMER: Look at sidebar - should show \"\U0001F4CA Hit Chance: XX%\" when GAMER is active. \u2705\n    GAMBLER: Combat - 10% crit, 10% auto-miss for chaotic moments. \u2705"
  - 'STORY-GATING TRAITS:'
  - "Create passages with locked doors, vehicles, etc.\n    Use the copy-paste patterns from STORY_GATING_QUICK_REFERENCE.txt\n    Test with and without perks to confirm gating works"
  - "\u2B07 CHECK FLOOR ITEMS BELOW \u2B07"
